            document.getElementById("P625_TOTAL_PRECIO_3").readOnly = true;
            document.getElementById("P625_TOTAL_PRECIO_4").readOnly = true;
            document.getElementById("P625_TOTAL_APROBADO_1").readOnly = true;
            document.getElementById("P625_TOTAL_APROBADO_2").readOnly = true;
            document.getElementById("P625_TOTAL_APROBADO_3").readOnly = true;
            document.getElementById("P625_TOTAL_APROBADO_4").readOnly = true;
            ```
